WEBVTT

00:08.633 --> 00:10.010
Mikey's CB250T.

00:15.098 --> 00:16.599
Mikey?

00:35.493 --> 00:36.870
Just what...

00:37.620 --> 00:40.165
are you guys doing on this day?

00:57.557 --> 00:58.975
BLACK DRAGON...

01:00.018 --> 01:00.852
Mikey.

01:03.396 --> 01:04.230
I'm sorry.

01:05.356 --> 01:06.941
I'm to blame for this.

01:09.110 --> 01:09.944
Taka.

01:10.945 --> 01:12.989
The truce I made...

01:13.907 --> 01:16.201
I irresponsibly broke myself.

01:16.951 --> 01:19.913
As you can see,
we're fighting BLACK DRAGON.

01:28.880 --> 01:33.134
My brother noticed
the sound of your Impulse.

01:36.679 --> 01:38.348
Then Baji said,

01:39.015 --> 01:42.894
"Only Mitsuya's bike purrs so sweetly."

01:57.659 --> 02:00.120
Those two led me here.

02:04.207 --> 02:05.208
Mikey...

02:06.960 --> 02:09.546
What're you talking about?

02:17.720 --> 02:20.181
TOKYO REVENGERS

03:47.060 --> 03:49.187
Those must be the guys you're fighting.

03:49.771 --> 03:52.857
So, you're the invincible Mikey, huh?

03:55.526 --> 03:56.945
Why are you interfering?

03:57.028 --> 03:57.904
Huh?

03:58.988 --> 04:01.532
I just want to ride with my guys again.

04:06.663 --> 04:11.417
If Mitsuya dies,
it'll just make my brother and Baji sad.

04:12.710 --> 04:14.671
Mikey, are you...

04:18.383 --> 04:20.551
Mikey's weak right now.

04:23.763 --> 04:27.183
I don't think
Mikey's going to last much longer.

04:27.267 --> 04:29.060
Mikey changed completely.

04:31.479 --> 04:35.233
Toman changed because Mikey changed.

04:35.733 --> 04:37.735
He doesn't trust his old friends anymore.

04:38.778 --> 04:40.655
He's not a hoodlum anymore.

04:42.156 --> 04:43.700
<i>Mikey has gone truly evil.</i>

04:45.702 --> 04:49.372
<i>Don't, Mikey!
You can't fight in that condition!</i>

05:03.428 --> 05:04.262
What?

05:09.392 --> 05:11.060
Mikey?

05:33.374 --> 05:38.546
Even the bells of Christmas
bless my victory.

05:38.629 --> 05:43.217
The invincible Mikey has been defeated!

05:44.469 --> 05:47.180
Impossible! And with just one blow.

05:47.263 --> 05:50.058
Taiju! Goddamn you!

05:50.141 --> 05:51.351
You're dead meat!

06:01.986 --> 06:03.404
Prayer time is over.

06:07.533 --> 06:09.994
I wouldn't do that if I were you,
Manjiro Sano.

06:10.745 --> 06:13.164
You're no match for our boss.

06:15.041 --> 06:19.337
SOUTH KANTO REFORM SCHOOL

06:19.420 --> 06:21.547
<i>By the time I got out of reform school,</i>

06:22.131 --> 06:25.051
<i>the ninth generation
of BLACK DRAGON had ended.</i>

06:26.094 --> 06:27.929
Leaving in your gang uniform?

06:28.930 --> 06:31.307
You're as nuts as ever, man.

06:31.391 --> 06:34.435
SEISHU INUI
THIRD-YEAR MIDDLE SCHOOL (AT THE TIME)

06:34.519 --> 06:37.188
I've been waiting for you, Inupi.

06:37.271 --> 06:39.524
HAJIME KOKONOI
THIRD-YEAR MIDDLE SCHOOL (AT THE TIME)

06:40.691 --> 06:43.319
Is it true BLACK DRAGON was wiped out?

06:43.861 --> 06:44.779
Yeah.

06:44.862 --> 06:49.534
Some punks a year younger than us
called Tokyo Manji Gang crushed them.

06:51.452 --> 06:53.913
I'll revive BLACK DRAGON.

06:54.414 --> 06:57.625
Because you were told
to lead the next generation?

06:58.584 --> 06:59.919
Things are different now.

07:01.087 --> 07:04.549
What do you think happened
to the guys who told you that?

07:06.467 --> 07:10.221
The Haitani Brothers of Roppongi
came to power and things got rough.

07:10.805 --> 07:12.723
They ditched the gang and vanished.

07:13.558 --> 07:17.145
Take the hint, man.
Forget about BLACK DRAGON.

07:22.900 --> 07:23.734
I don't mind.

07:24.610 --> 07:27.488
I'll revive BLACK DRAGON
even if I have to do it alone.

07:28.489 --> 07:29.657
Got a plan?

07:29.740 --> 07:30.575
No.

07:33.536 --> 07:36.330
There's a beast at my school.

07:38.374 --> 07:43.337
With his strength,
you might be able to revive BLACK DRAGON.

07:45.173 --> 07:46.132
Who is this guy?

07:46.757 --> 07:47.675
Want to meet him?

07:48.509 --> 07:50.761
I can't guarantee he'll help you.

07:52.263 --> 07:53.347
<i>That pissed me off.</i>

07:53.973 --> 07:58.019
<i>With his strength,
BLACK DRAGON could be revived?</i>

07:58.769 --> 08:03.316
<i>So if I can kick his ass,
then I've got that power.</i>

08:04.859 --> 08:05.693
This is it.

08:06.694 --> 08:08.529
<i>I wasn't going to recruit him.</i>

08:08.613 --> 08:10.281
<i>I was just going to beat him down.</i>

08:12.658 --> 08:14.035
Taiju, you here?

08:19.081 --> 08:20.166
This him?

08:21.042 --> 08:23.461
I want to see you
for a second, Taiju Shiba.

08:31.093 --> 08:32.303
TAIJU SHIBA
THIRD-YEAR MIDDLE SCHOOL (AT THE TIME)

08:32.386 --> 08:33.888
This better be fun.

08:35.973 --> 08:41.687
<i>Whether it was Toman, Moebius,
or the Haitani Brothers, I'd take them on.</i>

08:42.730 --> 08:46.025
<i>Until then, I'd never lost a single fight.</i>

08:54.158 --> 08:57.787
<i>That was how I met Taiju Shiba.</i>

09:00.373 --> 09:02.750
<i>He was far stronger than me.</i>

09:04.126 --> 09:06.170
You're the boss.

09:06.796 --> 09:07.713
Fine with me.

09:08.839 --> 09:11.842
I'll build a new BLACK DRAGON.

09:12.802 --> 09:13.761
In return...

09:14.262 --> 09:15.221
Kokonoi!

09:16.514 --> 09:19.225
You serve me too!

09:21.477 --> 09:23.312
<i>Taiju was sharp.</i>

09:24.021 --> 09:27.024
<i>He produced the money
to get the whole gang uniforms.</i>

09:27.108 --> 09:29.860
<i>BLACK DRAGON was reborn
with a renewed image.</i>

09:30.570 --> 09:34.365
<i>But that wasn't Taiju's true talent.</i>

10:01.601 --> 10:06.522
You're nothing more than a pebble
in the face of the boss's supreme might.

10:08.524 --> 10:12.320
I pummeled you
with my hardest punch today.

10:12.403 --> 10:15.573
But I guess one punch
isn't enough to take you down.

10:19.410 --> 10:20.328
Mikey...

10:24.040 --> 10:28.919
<i>Somehow, Mikey got back up,
but there's no way he'll survive.</i>

10:30.338 --> 10:32.256
<i>He still hasn't recovered</i>

10:33.090 --> 10:36.469
<i>from losing so many people
precious to him.</i>

10:37.470 --> 10:40.181
<i>What's more, he's facing Taiju Shiba.</i>

10:41.641 --> 10:42.933
<i>He's a monster!</i>

10:43.017 --> 10:46.354
Is that all the invincible Mikey's got?

10:46.437 --> 10:47.647
What a disappointment.

10:50.691 --> 10:53.027
<i>Mikey's going to lose?</i>

11:00.034 --> 11:01.661
That punch you gave me...

11:02.787 --> 11:04.622
It was my punishment to myself.

11:04.705 --> 11:05.539
Huh?

11:15.007 --> 11:15.841
What?

11:18.427 --> 11:19.637
<i>What just happened?</i>

11:19.720 --> 11:20.554
Boss?

11:27.603 --> 11:28.562
<i>For an instant,</i>

11:28.646 --> 11:30.356
<i>Mikey jumped into the air.</i>

11:31.065 --> 11:32.900
<i>Then there was a thud.</i>

11:32.983 --> 11:34.318
<i>Then...</i>

11:35.236 --> 11:36.404
<i>I lost sight of Taiju.</i>

11:42.410 --> 11:43.411
Boss...

11:44.161 --> 11:45.413
Impossible.

11:45.496 --> 11:47.373
Taiju was taken out with one blow?

11:48.791 --> 11:49.625
Boss!

11:50.334 --> 11:51.168
So that's...

11:53.087 --> 11:54.630
the invincible Mikey.

12:03.806 --> 12:06.892
So that's the invincible Mikey.

12:06.976 --> 12:09.103
With a single blow...

12:09.186 --> 12:11.564
That was awesome, Mikey.

12:12.398 --> 12:13.691
He's a beast.

12:14.400 --> 12:16.402
You had me scared for a second there.

12:18.946 --> 12:20.364
For Christmas,

12:21.615 --> 12:24.285
I always ride with my brother and Baji.

12:26.203 --> 12:27.371
Mikey...

12:41.469 --> 12:46.056
When I ride in the snow
on my brother's CB250T that he gave me

12:46.974 --> 12:50.478
and wear Baji's good luck charm,
I feel like I'm with them.

12:51.937 --> 12:52.772
Mementos of them...

12:55.149 --> 12:56.317
<i>That's all it was?</i>

12:56.400 --> 13:00.112
<i>The way he was talking,
I thought he'd lost his marbles.</i>

13:01.781 --> 13:05.785
My brother, Baji, and all you guys
are all in here in my heart.

13:10.080 --> 13:12.041
That's why I can be strong.

13:17.171 --> 13:18.005
Mikey...

13:20.466 --> 13:21.967
<i>Mikey's just fine.</i>

13:22.551 --> 13:23.844
<i>He won't turn evil.</i>

13:27.973 --> 13:31.685
Okay, you guys. Christmas may be over...

13:32.269 --> 13:33.646
But let's ride together.

13:38.567 --> 13:41.278
Hold it right there!

13:49.787 --> 13:52.540
This isn't over yet, Toman.

13:54.375 --> 13:55.209
Koko!

13:57.503 --> 13:59.630
Get the guys from outside.

13:59.713 --> 14:02.758
You're fighting
100 BLACK DRAGON soldiers now.

14:05.302 --> 14:09.139
None of you are getting out.

14:09.223 --> 14:11.016
It ends here!

14:11.600 --> 14:15.187
I never lose to anyone!

14:17.231 --> 14:18.190
Taiju.

14:22.152 --> 14:24.530
BLACK DRAGON is powerful.

14:24.613 --> 14:26.740
But you'll never create a new age.

14:29.493 --> 14:33.581
You're a good fighter,
but you've got no heart.

14:36.876 --> 14:38.586
We'll build a new age.

14:39.461 --> 14:41.046
Just watch us.

14:41.964 --> 14:44.300
You bastard!

14:46.594 --> 14:47.428
Let go, Inui!

14:48.012 --> 14:51.390
Damn it, Koko!
Where the hell are my soldiers?

14:55.311 --> 14:56.437
Get a move on!

14:57.187 --> 14:58.063
Boss...

14:58.147 --> 14:59.315
What?

15:00.441 --> 15:01.775
We've lost.

15:14.455 --> 15:15.789
You done in there too?

15:17.499 --> 15:18.834
What the hell happened?

15:22.379 --> 15:26.216
Could you tell Mikey
that I'm done out here?

15:32.014 --> 15:33.015
What's going on?

15:33.599 --> 15:34.433
Takemitchy.

15:35.893 --> 15:36.977
Can you still move?

15:37.436 --> 15:38.479
Oh, yeah.

15:39.188 --> 15:40.981
Hang in there a little longer.

15:41.065 --> 15:44.735
There are five of us in here
and 100 BLACK DRAGON soldiers outside.

15:45.861 --> 15:46.695
Right.

15:47.947 --> 15:51.575
Looks like Second Division's
got to kick some more ass, Hakkai.

15:51.659 --> 15:52.493
Sure thing.

16:01.251 --> 16:03.212
What're you so tense about?

16:05.464 --> 16:06.298
Draken?

16:07.675 --> 16:08.509
Mikey!

16:11.345 --> 16:13.430
All the dudes outside are out cold.

16:13.514 --> 16:18.602
Taiju Shiba lost to you, lost all his men,
and lost his will to fight.

16:19.937 --> 16:20.771
Good.

16:21.939 --> 16:22.773
What?

16:24.608 --> 16:25.442
Ow!

16:28.946 --> 16:31.365
BLACK DRAGON is dead.

16:34.410 --> 16:36.412
<i>-Toman wins!
-Toman wins!</i>

16:45.045 --> 16:46.505
He did this alone?

16:47.256 --> 16:51.343
Looks like the toughest beasts
are our number one and two.

16:51.427 --> 16:54.847
Holy shit! I'm getting goosebumps.

16:54.930 --> 16:56.432
You too, Takemitchy?

16:58.934 --> 17:00.019
Takemitchy?

17:04.398 --> 17:05.274
<i>Taiju...</i>

17:06.191 --> 17:07.234
<i>Hakkai...</i>

17:08.152 --> 17:09.194
<i>Yuzuha...</i>

17:10.029 --> 17:11.155
<i>Mitsuya...</i>

17:12.656 --> 17:15.075
<i>They're all alive!</i>

17:16.702 --> 17:20.789
<i>We got through Christmas
without a single person dying.</i>

17:22.458 --> 17:24.626
Mission complete.

17:26.670 --> 17:27.546
You're right.

17:29.548 --> 17:30.549
Takemitchy!

17:48.734 --> 17:50.903
Thanks, Takemitchy.

17:51.737 --> 17:53.947
Mikey. Draken.

17:54.031 --> 17:56.950
It's thanks to you
that we defeated BLACK DRAGON.

17:58.160 --> 18:00.037
But today's hero is...

18:00.704 --> 18:01.705
Takemitchy.

18:24.311 --> 18:25.604
It's over, isn't it?

18:29.608 --> 18:31.944
Boss, we're through.

18:33.403 --> 18:36.365
It was a nice dream,
as fleeting as it was.

18:40.202 --> 18:41.954
What'll you do, Koko?

18:44.039 --> 18:46.708
I'll stick with you, obviously.

18:51.004 --> 18:52.339
Later, Taiju.

19:12.442 --> 19:15.362
How's it feel to lose for the first time?

19:19.908 --> 19:20.951
You're tough.

19:22.077 --> 19:23.287
You'll recover quickly.

19:24.621 --> 19:28.876
But me and Yuzuha
will never submit to you again.

19:32.129 --> 19:34.339
I was mistaken to try and kill you.

19:35.716 --> 19:38.385
But as long as
you keep beating on your family,

19:40.012 --> 19:41.430
I'll keep on fighting.

19:55.194 --> 19:58.572
If you don't change even after all this,

19:59.364 --> 20:00.365
you're a fool.

20:02.492 --> 20:04.119
Ever since Mom died,

20:05.245 --> 20:07.247
you've never talked about her.

20:08.749 --> 20:10.918
You moped around and blamed yourself.

20:12.377 --> 20:14.671
You were always alone all that time.

20:17.424 --> 20:18.634
I was the same.

20:19.551 --> 20:20.636
I thought I was alone.

20:22.387 --> 20:24.765
What is family, anyway?

20:28.268 --> 20:30.229
I hate you so much I wanted you dead.

20:31.813 --> 20:32.814
But I love you.

22:18.462 --> 22:19.338
Huh?

22:20.255 --> 22:22.716
Did I fall asleep?

22:26.428 --> 22:28.513
You up, Takemitchy?

22:28.597 --> 22:29.723
Mikey?

22:29.806 --> 22:32.726
Oh, damn! I hurt all over.

22:32.809 --> 22:34.644
Don't fall off!

22:37.731 --> 22:39.733
What? Where is everyone?

22:39.816 --> 22:40.901
They left.

23:05.592 --> 23:06.551
We're here.

23:06.635 --> 23:07.594
What?

23:16.728 --> 23:18.021
<i>Isn't this...</i>

23:36.498 --> 23:37.332
<i>What?</i>

23:38.041 --> 23:38.875
<i>Hina...</i>

23:38.959 --> 23:40.961
Translation by Brian Athey
